<title>USA: Invacare extends Healthdyne offer.</title>
<headline>Invacare extends Healthdyne offer.</headline>
<dateline>ELYRIA, Ohio 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Invacare Corp said Monday it extended until August 1 its offer to buy all outstanding shares of Healthdyne Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>Invacare said the offer was scheduled to expire June 20.</p>
<p>The company said about 3.9 million shares have been tendered so far and, together with the 600,000 shares of Healthdyne it already owned, the shares constitute more than 35 percent of outstanding Healthdyne common stock.</p>
<p>Invacare recently raised its tender offer to $15 per share. Healthdyne has said, however, that it was exploring alternatives to the takeover offer.</p>
</text>
